 "category": "Pads and atmospheres",
 "text": "Sound: a dark, breathing drone: low hum and hiss in a huge space, a resonant band slowly moving through it. The bed under an industrial track.\n\nHow it's built: pink noise and a low saw mixed into the State-Variable filter's band-pass, with RESONANCE up so it rings; a very slow LFO moves the CUTOFF. The envelope fades it in over seconds and out over more. A long Delay and a big Reverb.\n\nPlay: hold one low note (or two).\n\nTweak: the LFO's RATE, the filter's RESONANCE and CV, the mixer's noise level, the reverb's SIZE.",
